"Agent 写的：负责人、协作者和值班在任务里记下之后还用得上的事（怎么跑测试、踩过的坑、为什么这样做），每条记着谁在哪个任务里写的。" = "Agents write it: the lead, collaborators and Loops note what later runs will need (how to run the tests, a trap they fell into, why something is the way it is), each note saying who wrote it in which run.";
"不会塞进每个任务的说明里：Agent 只知道这里有多少条，需要时按关键词检索，拿到最相关的几条。它是笔记不是规则：用之前先核对，和共享资料冲突时以共享资料为准。" = "Notes are not put in every run's instructions: agents only learn how many there are, and search them when they need to, getting the best matches. Notes are not rules: they are checked before use, and the shared context wins when they disagree.";
